   448|        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">This platform measures the structural gap between financial media reporting and actual institutional capital migration. Dispatches are analyzed and scored based on the magnitude of divergence between qualitative consensus narratives and quantitative asset-class flow volumes; large contradiction gaps receive priority visibility on the ledger.</p>
   449|      </div>
